title: date_tsuru_2_intro
location: park
---

You have a day off. Away from the full-time insanity of HQ...
A perfect time to catch up on errands.
{$name}: (Oh! Vice Admiral Tsuru is here.)
It may be a good opportunity to get to know her outside of work...
-> Greet her.
    {$name}:  Hello, Vice Admiral Tsuru! <<set td2_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: Ah... Good afternoon, {$name}.
    Tsuru: You seem in a good mood!
-> Say nothing.
    <<set td2_points -=1>>
    T sees you watching her awkwardly and approaches first.
    Tsuru: Well, don't just stand there!
    Tsuru: Are you hiding from me?
    -> {$name}: I didn't see you.
        <<set td2_points -=1>>
        Tsuru: ...
        Tsuru: Hmm.
    -> {$name}:: Yes! You scare me.
        <<set td2_points +=1>>
        Tsuru: Oh.
        --Tsuru scoffs-- //HOW DO??
-> Wave at her.
    Tsuru: Hello, {$name}.
Tsuru: Are you enjoying your day off?
- No. It's hard for me to take days off! <<set td2_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: I know you work hard.
    Tsuru: But it's healthy to distract oneself if the time is there.
(If you had a bad run in the last date:) //HOW DO??
    Tsuru: I wouldn't have known!
    Tsuru: Well... At least you're applying yourself.
- It's nice to have a break from the chaos at work!
    Tsuru: ... After yesterday, I must agree.
    Tsuru: I'm sorry that the old geezers are behaving like they're children...*Again.*
-Yes, are you off as well? <<set td2_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: Oh. Thank you for asking.
Tsuru: I am running errands on behalf of HQ, actually. And afterwards I need to pick up a cake... I'll just get on my way.
{$name}: Wait, I...
-> I am going to pick up a cake too...
    <<jump date_tsuru_2_route1>>
-> What kind of errands?
    <<jump date_tsuru_2_route2>>
===

title: date_tsuru_2_route1
location: town
---

Tsuru: Oh? What a coincidence!
Tsuru: This is where I am going.
Tsuru hands you a pastel pink visit card.
**Heart Confectionery & Teahouse** is written in loopy cursive.
It doesn't look like a regular bakery...
-> Yes, that's where I wanted to go.
    {$name}: (A little white lie never hurt anybody...)
    Tsuru: Well... Very good.
    <<jump date_tsuru_2_route1_heartMain>>
-> I've changed my mind.
     Tsuru: I see. Did you mean you have other things to do in the city?
    Tsuru: I won't keep distracting you, then.
    Tsuru: See you tomorrow, {$name}.
    <<jump date_tsuru_2_earlyEnd>>
===

title: date_tsuru_2_route1_heartMain
location: town
---

The two of you arrive at the confectionery.
It's a shop, painted white, with the kind of tables and tea sets outside you've only seen given to dolls.
A lovingly detailed sign, shaped like a wedding cake, bids you welcome.
Tsuru: Here we are!
Shop Assistant: Welcome.
Shop Assistant: How may I help you?
Tsuru: Go first, {$name}, please.
{$name}: ...
- I wanted a few of the chocolate pralines.
    Shop Assistant: Oh! For sure.
    Shop Assistant: For what kind of occasion?
    -> What do you mean?
        Shop Assistant: A wedding? Birthday?
        Shop Assistant: We'll make minimum fifty pieces.
        Tsuru: Are you sure you want to order, {$name}?
        -> Why not?
            <<set td2_points -=1>>
            Shop Assistant: Oh, so they're for you? Have a sweet tooth, don't we?
            Shop Assistant: Here are our price listings.
            Ouch... The list the assistant hands you makes your stomach sink.
            It's going a bit far for a little white lie...
            Tsuru: I find it pricey for a personal fancy.
            Tsuru: But who am I to judge?
            -> Yes, I will order.
                <<set td2_points -=1>>
                <<jump tsuru_2_route1_outside_1>>
            -> No, I'm not interested.
                <<set td2_points +=1>>
                Shop Assistant: Oh!
                Tsuru: I thought so...
                <<jump date_tsuru_2_route1_cake>>
        -> No... I'm not interested.
            Tsuru: I thought so...
            <<jump date_tsuru_2_route1_cake>>
    -> No, I just want something to eat.
        <<set td2_points -=1>>
        Tsuru: {$name}, you sound like Garp.
        Shop Assistant: Do you mean you'd... Um... Like a sample?
        -> Is it food?
            <<set td2_points -=1>>
            Tsuru: {$name}... Behave!
            Tsuru: If you're only here to irritate me, get yourself on your way!
            Tsuru doesn't look too happy...
            <<jump date_tsuru_2_earlyEnd>>
        -> {$name}: Oh, I misunderstood. I'm sorry.
            <<set td2_points +=1>>
            Shop Assistant: No problem!
            Shop Assistant: (What a weird couple...)
            Tsuru: Oh, that explains everything.
            Tsuru: Will you wait for me outside while I pick up my order?
            -> Sure thing!
                <<jump date_tsuru_2_route1_outside_2>>
            -> For a promotion!
                <<jump date_tsuru_2_route1_promotion>>
-> I just want something to eat!
    Shop Assistant: You mean as in... Um... A sample?
    - {$name}: Is it food? <<set td2_points -=1>>
        Tsuru: {$name}... Behave!
        Tsuru: If you're only here to irritate me, get yourself on your way!
        Tsuru doesn't look too happy...
        <<jump date_tsuru_2_earlyEnd>>
    - {$name}: Oh, I misunderstood. <<set td2_points +=1>>
        {$name}: I thought I could just order something to eat here.
        Shop Assistant: Oh, I see!
        Tsuru: Of course.
        Tsuru: Will you wait for me outside while I pick up my order?
        <<jump date_tsuru_2_route1_outside_2>>
-> I'll have a tea to go, please.
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
    <<jump date_tsuru_2_route1_tea>>
===

title: date_tsuru_2_route1_outside_1
location: town
---

You exit the confectionery with 50 pralines you didn't want...
Tsuru has picked up her order.
{$name}: What can I say? I really love chocolate.
Tsuru: I don't doubt it.
Tsuru: ...
Tsuru: Tell me something, {$name}.
Tsuru: Did you only come here to spend time with me?
    -> {$name}: Yes...
        <<set td2_points +=1>>
        Tsuru: I thought so.
        Tsuru: You really didn't have to go through all these leaps, {$name}.
            -> {$name}: I'm sorry, ma'am.
                <<set td2_points +=1>>
                Tsuru sighs.
                Tsuru: No, no... I realize what it must be to start anew somewhere.
                Tsuru: Maybe I should apologize for being too focused on my own tasks.
                Tsuru: In fact... This whole situation is funny.
                {$name}: So you knew and let me buy all this stuff?!
                Tsuru: Cause and consequence!
                Tsuru: I'm sure you can find some use for them.
                <<jump date_tsuru_2_route1_end_neutral>>
    -> {$name}: No!
        <<set td2_points -=1>>
        <<jump date_tsuru_2_route1_end_bad>>
===

title: date_tsuru_2_route1_end_neutral
location: town
---

Tsuru helps you carry the trays of confections very carefully.
Tsuru: Well, this is quite the amount of chocolate...
-> We should take it back to HQ.
    Tsuru: If you do that, Garp will devour it in one sitting.
    Tsuru: It's still a good idea.
-> Let us eat some of it first.
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: ...
    Tsuru: I don't usually like sweets.
    Tsuru: ...I'll take a little bit.
    You sit down on the porcelain tea tables and share a quiet moment...
    It seems this didn't go that badly after all!
    <<jump date_tsuru_2_end>>
===

title: date_tsuru_2_route1_end_bad
location: town
---

Tsuru shakes her head.
Tsuru: If that is the case, your behavior was very strange!
Tsuru: You must be honest with yourself, {$name}! You won't achieve anything otherwise.
That didn't go too well...
<<jump date_tsuru_2_badendcomplete>>
===

title: date_tsuru_2_route1_promotion
location: town
---

Shop Assistant: Brilliant! I'll bring the price list!
Tsuru: ...a promotion?
Tsuru: We did celebrate that already, didn't we?
-> It's just a belated present.
    <<jump date_tsuru_2_route1_present>>
-> {$name}: But it was so chaotic...
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: That is true...
    Tsuru: It could be a good idea, for team cohesion.
-> {$name}: True! I forgot!
    <<set td2_points -=1>>
