title: date_tsuru_2_route1_present
location: town
---

Tsuru glances at you...
Wait... What idea is she getting?
Tsuru: Ah-hah. So 50 pralines as a belated present?
Shop Assistant: I'm here with the price list!
Those numbers almost make you jump!
-> This is too much.
-> UH nevermind.
Tsuru: No, please do.
Tsuru: We don't want to make Rosinante wait, do we?
Tsuru smiles and nods at you.
She might have gotten the completely wrong idea...
<<jump date_tsuru_2_route1_cake>>
