---

Tsuru: Well, now that that is clear...
Tsuru: I will pick up my order, please.
Shop Assistant: A birthday cake, right?
Tsuru: Yes.
Shop Assistant: I'll be back in a moment.
-> Is it somebody's birthday?
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: One of my subordinates and a close friend...
    Tsuru: You couldn't have known.
    -> Say nothing.
        Tsuru: Don't worry. You didn't miss a birthday. You couldn't have known.
    -> Is it Sengoku's or Garp's birthday?
        <<set td2_points -=1>>
        Tsuru: No.
        Tsuru shakes her head gravely.
Shop Assistant: Here we go!
The cake has two pink tiers, glazed pink-white, with a black decoration in the shape of a stylized spider complete with a web on top.
Tsuru: Well, what do you think?
-> It's very... nice!
    Tsuru chuckles, the sound making you tingle for some reason.
    Tsuru: It's not something that I would get for myself...
-> It's... not what I was expecting!
    Tsuru: I should think so!
    Tsuru: It's not something that I would get for myself...
-> I've seen this pattern before...
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
        - On somebody's uniform. <<set td2_points -=1>>
            Tsuru: ...? (Are they making things up again?)
        - On a bounty poster. <<set td2_points -=1>>
            Tsuru: (Are they making things up again?)
        - On a tattoo. <<set td2_points +=1>>
            Tsuru: That's a good memory!
            Tsuru: You must have met Gion, then. She leaves quite the impression, doesn't she?
While you chatted, the Vice Admiral has paid.
Shop Assistant: Thank you for your visit~!
<<jump date_tsuru_2_route1_end_best>>
===

title: date_tsuru_2_route1_end_best
location: town
---

The two of you are outside again by the white-painted walls.
Tsuru:... {$name}.
Tsuru: You were curious, weren't you?
Tsuru: Tell me the truth. Is that why you came here?
-> Not at all!
    <<set td2_points -=1>>
    She sighs.
    Tsuru: I see.
-> Well...
    Tsuru: I thought so.
    Tsuru: Call it feminine intuition. Anyway...
Tsuru: I ordered this cake for Gion. If you want to make friends, you should come to her birthday party. (**) //ASK MYST WHAT THIS MEANS
Tsuru: You don't have to decide yet, but think about it.
She bids you goodbye and you find yourself pondering if you should go to the party of not. But would you be going to make frineds or... to see a certain silver fox who buys birthday cakes?
<<jump date_tsuru_2_end>>
