---

You wait outside again by the white-painted walls.
Tsuru comes out with a pink confectionery package and two cups of tea.
Tsuru: There is no cake to eat, but I thought I ouught to show all new workers what a decent green tea tastes like!
-> Thank you!
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: My pleasure.
-> I prefer black!
    <<set td2_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: Well, you have no choice.
Tsuru: Well now...
-> What's in the package?
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: Curious, aren't you?
    Tsuru: Tell me the truth. Is that why you came here?
    -> Not at all!
        <<set td2_points -=1>>
        She sighs.
        Tsuru: Well. Even if you won't be honest with me...
    -> Well...
        Tsuru: I thought so.
        Tsuru: Call it feminine intuition. Anyway...
Tsuru: There's a cake inside of course. For a very special person.
Tsuru: You'll find out over the next few days I'm sure.
Her favorite tea is thick and delicious. Tsuru finishes hers and prepares to leave.
Tsuru: It was a pleasure to see you. A shame I am not less busy.
Tsuru: Until tomorrow.
<<jump date_tsuru_2_end>>
