You start to walk along next to the Vice Admiral as she speaks.
Tsuru: Well, {$name}, we all like to have some things in the office that are not absolutely necessary...
-> Like rice cakes for Garp?
    Tsuru: I do wonder if I should stop indulging him!
    Tsuru: As long as he behaves...
-> Like better coffee than the cheap stuff our subordinates drink?
    <<set td2_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: That's unnecessarily arrogant, {$name}!
-> Like goat feed to keep some unnamed pets from eating documents?
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
    She sighs.
    Tsuru: Exactly.
Tsuru: I am going to restock some of the supplies. After all, it's busy days ahead...
May I help you?
Tsuru: Oh, but not on your day off.
-> I need a few things myself actually!
    Tsuru: If you insist.
-> It's not really working if we're outside the office!
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
