title: date_tsuru_2_route2_pet
location: town
---

The two of you enter the pet shop... “Pet” seems to have a very broad definition here.
Shop Assistant: Hello, Madam Tsuru!
Shop Assistant: Do we need to order food for the baby elephant today?
Tsuru: Oh, no, thank you.
{$name}: We are here for...
-> Leashes for all our colleagues.
    <<set td2_points -=1>>
    Shop Assistant: Ah...?
    Tsuru: ...
    Tsuru: Behave.
    Tsuru: We actually need hay, please.
-> Seagull snacks.
    Tsuru: That's very sweet of you.
    Tsuru: But we need something else.
    Tsuru: We actually need hay, please.
-> Hay and grain, a lot of it.
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: Exactly.
Shop Assistant: Of course! Let me see what I can find...
Tsuru: *sigh*... That goat is a menace...
-> They say Sengoku-san has changed a lot in the last two years.
    <<set td2_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: Don't pay mind to what *they* say.
    Tsuru: Sengoku hasn't changed.
-> Maybe we should help Sengoku-san train it!
    Tsuru: No, it *is* trained.
    Tsuru: That's the point...
    Tsuru: ...
    Tsuru: It's a long story.
-> Sengoku-san seems so happy with his semi-retirement!
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: He'd be happier completely retired!
    Tsuru: Although, of course, no Fleet Admiral will ever do that.
    Tsuru: One thing is true— I haven't seen him smiling like that in so long!
Shop Assistant: Here we go~ Thank you for your visit!
Tsuru: Where to now? Your choice.
    - Grocery Store
        <<jump date_tsuru_2_route2_food>>
    - Teahouse
        <<jump date_tsuru_2_route2_tea>>
- Liquor Store
    <<jump date_tsuru_2_route2_smokers>>
