title: date_tsuru_2_route2_food
location: town
---

It's an old-fashioned market inside a big building of iron and stained glass. As you go in, the smells and bright colors sweep you away.
Tsuru: What did we need to buy?
-> Garp's rice cakes!
    Tsuru: I wonder if we should at all! They're always gone in less than a day.
    Tsuru: But...
-> How about some fruit for everybody to snack on?
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: That's a lovely idea, {$name}.
    Tsuru: *If we must*, we'll get some rice cakes as well...
-> Let's not buy anything!
    <<set td2_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: {$name}, you're supposed to be helpful.
Tsuru: It would be unfair to buy something for everyone *but* Garp...
-> He doesn't take anything seriously!
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: My thoughts exactly.
    Tsuru: Although... He's much more than he seems.
    Tsuru: You can count on him when the time calls for it.
-> I can't believe the Hero of the Marines is like that!
    <<set td2_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: ...
    Tsuru: He's much more than what meets the eye.
    Tsuru: Heroism has nothing to do with presentation... But with deeds.
It takes a while, but you end up with a nice heap of fruit for the offices and enough rice cakes to survive the week!
Tsuru: So, where are we heading now?
- Pet Shop
    <<jump date_tsuru_2_route2_pet>>
- Teahouse
    <<jump date_tsuru_2_route2_tea>>
- Liquor Store
