title: date_tsuru_2_route2_smokers
location: town
---

Tsuru: The liquor store?!
Tsuru: You do know we're to buy supplies for *work*...
-> I was thinking about Rosinante's cigarettes!
    <<set td2_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: Oh, so *that* is what you mean!
