title: date_tsuru_2_badendcomplete
location: quarters
---

You return to your quarters, thinking over the day. It certainly could have gone better. By a lot. You fully expect the Vice Admiral to innundate you with paperwork tomorrow.
===

title: date_tsuru_2_earlyEnd
location: quarters
---

Back to your regularly scheduled programming: a whole day off and a comfy bed!
===

title: date_tsuru_2_end
location: quarters
---

You arrive back home and flop on your bed with a smile. Spending time with the Vice Admiral was the highlight of your day. You can't wait to see her again tomorrow. And the others too, of course!
===
